#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:3
msgid "Icon Themes"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:5
msgid ""
"Extensions may provide icon themes to change the icons Zed uses for folders "
"and files."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:7
msgid "Example extension"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:9
msgid ""
"The [Material Icon Theme](https://github.com/zed-extensions/material-icon-"
"theme) serves as an example for the structure of an extension containing an "
"icon theme."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:11
msgid "Directory structure"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:13
msgid "There are two important directories for an icon theme extension:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:15
msgid ""
"`icon_themes`: This directory will contain one or more JSON files containing "
"the icon theme definitions."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:16
msgid ""
"`icons`: This directory contains the icon assets distributed with the "
"extension. You can create subdirectories in this directory as needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/icon-themes.md:18
msgid ""
"Each icon theme file should adhere to the JSON schema specified at [`https://"
"zed.dev/schema/icon_themes/v0.3.0.json`](https://zed.dev/schema/icon_themes/"
"v0.3.0.json)."
msgstr ""

